kDefs":467,"style":450},"ba0c4900154c",[454,458,463],{"_key":455,"_type":434,"marks":456,"text":457},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3f2P",[],"This past weekend, ",{"_key":459,"_type":434,"marks":460,"text":462},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3f3Y",[461],"0ce51346-3a19-462e-bd4e-070d67571e8b","Nominal",{"_key":464,"_type":434,"marks":465,"text":466},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3f4h",[]," hosted an exclusive, invite-only evening where finance pros, CFOs, and accounting innovators got together - not just to talk shop, but to truly connect. We cheered on the Florida Panthers, shared real-world experiences, and dug into how AI is transforming finance operations.",[468],{"_key":461,"_type":448,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":469},"https:\u002F\u002Fnominal.so\u002F",{"_key":471,"_type":430,"children":472,"markDefs":477,"style":478},"5e1c5c78fb20",[473],{"_key":474,"_type":434,"marks":475,"text":476},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3f5q",[],"Beyond the Buzzwords: Real Conversations, Real Connections",[],"h3",{"_key":480,"_type":430,"children":481,"markDefs":486,"style":450},"6e34a65938f6",[482],{"_key":483,"_type":434,"marks":484,"text":485},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3f6z",[],"AI, AI agents, automation, financial close, multi-entity consolidation—we all know these are the hot topics in finance and accounting right now. But at Nomi Fest, the conversation went deeper.",[],{"_key":488,"_type":430,"children":489,"level":17,"listItem":494,"markDefs":495,"style":450},"40d3f7bcdefe",[490],{"_key":491,"_type":434,"marks":492,"text":493},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fAQ",[],"How do finance teams actually scale with AI and AI Agents?","bullet",[],{"_key":497,"_type":430,"children":498,"level":17,"listItem":494,"markDefs":503,"style":450},"59c838c9709d",[499],{"_key":500,"_type":434,"marks":501,"text":502},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fCi",[],"Where are the biggest challenges in financial consolidation today?",[],{"_key":505,"_type":430,"children":506,"level":17,"listItem":494,"markDefs":511,"style":450},"8e23d499cf01",[507],{"_key":508,"_type":434,"marks":509,"text":510},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fF0",[],"How do we move from just automating to actually transforming workflows?",[],{"_key":513,"_type":430,"children":514,"markDefs":519,"style":450},"9e49fdb554b1",[515],{"_key":516,"_type":434,"marks":517,"text":518},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fHI",[],"This wasn’t some giant conference. It was authentic, candid, and full of real talk from leaders who are actually driving these changes in their organizations. And honestly, there’s nothing better than being in a room where everyone gets it - where you can swap ideas, share challenges, and leave feeling inspired.",[],{"_key":521,"_type":430,"children":522,"markDefs":527,"style":478},"c9d4c98653e0",[523],{"_key":524,"_type":434,"marks":525,"text":526},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fIR",[],"Shoutout to those joined us at Nomi Fest",[],{"_key":529,"_type":430,"children":530,"markDefs":535,"style":450},"26c2d9755a83",[531],{"_key":532,"_type":434,"marks":533,"text":534},"07Tz8UWJnMcGO2oGCZ3fJa",[],"A huge THANK YOU to everyone who joined us. You made the night what it was - insightful and engaging. It’s always great to put faces to names, but even better to build real relationships and network with like-minded leaders near you.",[],{"_key":537,"_type":538,"data":539,"image":550,"markDefs":9,"type":551},"159228df9c69","media",{"alt":9,"altText":540,"asset":541,"bgColor":543,"caption":9,"dimensions":544,"lqip":548,"originalFilename":549},"group of people at the NHL game, in the Nomi Festival",{"_ref":542,"_type":13},"image-373dc881d580d8800cc616baedc5a8c13a86b593-5712x4284-jpg","#c6bab1",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":545,"height":546,"width":547},1.3333333333333333,4284,5712,"data:image\u002Fjpeg;base64,\u002F9j\u002F2wBDAAYEBQYFBAYGBQYHBwYIChAKCgkJChQODwwQFxQYGBcUFhYaHSUfGhsjHBYWICwgIyYnKSopGR8tMC0oMCUoKSj\u002F2wBDAQcHBwoIChMKChMoGhYaKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCj\u002FwAARCAAPABQDASIAAhEBAxEB\u002F8QAGAAAAwEBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUHAQT\u002Fx